metadata:
  intent: "Loop Engineering MVP para o Touring: um orquestrador de loop agentic hibrido-autonomo. Construir (fatia-fina): (1) skill loop-engineering (SKILL.md, o cerebro de orquestracao: protocolo do loop, gate de convergencia mensuravel, pontos de human-gate, referencias aos scripts e a um AGENTS.md de manutencao do bundle estilo OpenKB); (2) scripts/loop_diagnose.py (diagnostico one-shot compondo touring map+scout+blast+touring-quality --workspace+wiring chains+memory recall num digest JSON+OKF); (3) scripts/loop_converged.py (gate de convergencia mensuravel: decompose-ready-vazio E touring-quality>=0.80 E 0 dims P0 Fail E orphans<=baseline E cargo check/test/clippy verde E cross-audit limpo; exit0=convergiu exit1=continua+unmet[]+next_action); (4) scripts/loop_phase_close.py (phase-close: memory store + learning reward + decompose update/finalize + append plan.md + relatorio de fase OKF-compliant + Knowledge Abstract tipado estilo Hyper-Extract com entity_id/relation_id deterministicos + wikilinks); (5) scripts/loop_doc_link_gate.py (validador OKF: schema frontmatter + resolucao de links bundle-relative + lint de contradicoes estilo OpenKB); (6) dois hooks em settings.json: Stop loop-stop-guard (nao-convergiu injeta continue+proxima-subtask-ready) e PreCompact loop-snapshot (snapshot do loop-state que sobrevive compactacao, analogo checkpointer LangGraph); (7) convencao de bundle .md OKF-compliant (index.md+log.md+frontmatter+cross-links bundle-relative) como ledger duravel resumivel. Doc-layer: adotar OKF integralmente; adotar padroes Hyper-Extract+OpenKB nativamente (sem deps Python externas no MVP; ferramentas reais deferidas). Reusar primitivas Touring existentes (master commands, decompose DAG, touring-quality); zero CLI nova."
